{"page": 3, "kind": "cell", "table": 1, "row": 7, "col": 4, "x": null, "text": "• How People Change Rules and Laws: being elected to office, petitioning government, protests, strikes, voting • Changes to Society: civil rights, mandatory seat belts, voting rights, wearing helmets when riding bikes, women’s suffrage", "id": "u48", "furniture": false}
